/*******************************************************************************
 * CancellationNotificationHandler
 *
 * Travel / Cancellation / Notification handling. One of ~220 peril handlers registered in PerilHandlerRegistry (registration order matters, see REG-44986)
 *
 * ORIGINALLY GENERATED BY: POLARIS-2-GW migration toolkit v2.3 (Project Mercury)
 *
